/*******************************************************************************
**
** Function         BTM_SecClrUCDService
**
** Description
**
** Parameters       Service ID - Id of the service to remove. ('0' removes all service
**                          records.
**
** Returns          Number of records that were freed.
**
*******************************************************************************/
